DESCRIPTION:Doors: 19:30h\, Stereo Deathray: 20:00\, The Muddy Moon: 21:00   THE MUDDY MOON – ist Patrick „Laschi“ Laschober (Gitarre\, Gesang)\, Dominik „Staffa“ Staffa (Schlagzeug)\, Manuel „Tyson“ Bauer (Bass) und Daniel „Jimmy“ Radosztics (Gitarre\, Mundharmonika). The Muddy Moon zelebrieren erdigen Rock ´n´ Roll und Blues\, wie ihn der Teufel in seinem eigenen Beisl abspielen würde. 4 hearts filled with Rock’n’Roll.. ergibt eine musikalische Vielfalt die man so auch in den tiefen Sumpflandschaften finden würde. www.themuddymoon.com www.instagram.com/themuddymoon www.facebook.com/.../The-Muddy-Moon/100094632537078/    STEREO DEATHRAY After spending quite some time hiding away in the studio\, Stereo Deathray are back – fresher\, louder and weirder than ever! With their upcoming single Black Witch\, the band invites you into a wild fever dream of raw ’60s garage rock and dripping-wet surf sounds\, all infused with their unmistakable punk rock attitude. Expect fuzz-drenched guitars\, reverb-soaked waves and a healthy dose of untamed energy. Stereo Deathray are back to shake things up – and they’re not here to play it safe. www.instagram.com/stereodeathray https://youtube.com/channel/UClRZosUuJgpVYXLQvgbSW6g?si=EkwuwZ4ZDTXxMI1Y
URL:https://www.chelsea.co.at/concerts.php#concert_6718
